<![CDATA[Hi, hope you are doing well!<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b><a href="http://info.memphisinvest.com/rick-luebbert-one-to-one">As promised on the voicemail I left for you today, here is the link you can use to schedule a call with me on a good day/time for you.</a></b></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">As interest rates are likely going up again this summer, I would encourage you to schedule a call soon if you have plans to add to your passive income portfolio this year.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">If you are interested in adding to your portfolio right now, please reply to this email and let me know (including your criteria if you already know what you want) in addition to scheduling a call.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Perhaps you want to talk about the state of the current markets in which we operate, or maybe you did not even know that in addition to Memphis, Dallas-Ft.Worth, and Houston, that we also are fully up and running in Little Rock and Oklahoma City as well.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b>***I'm attaching a few example properties so you can see how typical properties are looking across our 5 markets.***</b></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Looking forward to connecting with you.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Rick Luebbert&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial" size="2"><b style="border-collapse: separate; line-height: 24px;"><font color="#1155cc"><a href="http://info.memphisinvest.com/rick-luebbert-one-to-one">CLICK HERE TO SCHEDULE A 15 MINUTE CALL WITH ME</a></font></b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial" size="2"><b style="border-collapse: separate; line-height: 24px;"><font color="#1155cc"><a href="http://info.memphisinvest.com/rick-luebbert-one-to-one">THIS WEEK!</a></font></b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial" size="2"><b style="border-collapse: separate; line-height: 24px;"><br></b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: georgia, serif; border-collapse: separate;"><font size="1" style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif;" color="#f26522">Cell</font><font color="#000000" size="1" style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: verdana, sans-serif;">: +901.628.5959</font></span></div><div style="font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-collapse: separate; font-family: georgia, serif;"><font color="#f26522" size="1" style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: verdana, sans-serif;">E</font><font color="#000000" size="1" style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: verdana, sans-serif;">: </font><font color="#3333ff"><font size="1" style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif;">rick<a href="mailto:brett@memphisinvest.com" target="_blank">@memphisinvest.com</a></font><font size="1" style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif;"><br><font><a href="http://www.memphisinvest.com/" target="_blank">http://www.MemphisInvest.com</a></font></font></font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><div><br class="Apple-interchange-newline"><br></div></div>]]></td>
